[Opening "Fried Liver Attack"]
[Variation "9...b5"]
[ECO "C57"]
[Character "tactical"]
[Risk "medium"]
[EarlyMate "none"]
[Tricks "trap,hanging-piece"]
[Refutes "1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bc4 Nf6 4. Ng5 d5 5. exd5 Nxd5 6. Nxf7 Kxf7 7. Qf3+ Ke6 8. Nc3 Ncb4 9. O-O b5"]

1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bc4 Nf6 4. Ng5 d5 5. exd5 Nxd5 6. Nxf7 Kxf7 7. Qf3+ Ke6 8. Nc3 Ncb4 9. O-O b5? { Kicks the bishop, but it does not solve the pin on d5. } 10. Bb3 { Keeps the pin and keeps the bishop safe. White still threatens Nxd5 and then Qe4+. [%cal Gb3d5] } 10... c6 11. a3 { Chases the knight from b4, so the pinned knight on d5 loses a defender. } 11... Qf6 12. Qe4 12... Qg6 13. Qxg6 13... hxg6 14. axb4 *
